        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d22b7746-7f3d-4445-9afa-c3bf2c5449cd
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1459, y: -250}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Ten sam! Bezbo\u017Cnik jeden, tfu!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 1185023069381984407
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: eb2c1e3f-c8c4-4f89-b312-eeb6d40a28ee
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 2149ca95-4388-454f-a413-896d59ab11dc
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d22b7746-7f3d-4445-9afa-c3bf2c5449cd
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2366, y: -243}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Do tego unikn\u0105\u0142 odpowiedzialno\u015Bci
          za swoje przest\u0119pstwo!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 1185023069381984408
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 8db20b6e-1b10-4409-a696-8fc265edf54d
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: eb2c1e3f-c8c4-4f89-b312-eeb6d40a28ee
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d22b7746-7f3d-4445-9afa-c3bf2c5449cd
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1916, y: -251}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "\rPotr\u0105ci\u0142 nasz\u0105 kole\u017Cank\u0119,
          kiedy sz\u0142a na k\xF3\u0142ko r\xF3\u017Ca\u0144cowe!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 1185023069381984409
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 2149ca95-4388-454f-a413-896d59ab11dc
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 71436129-3e38-4628-8115-1a0835cfaff8
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d22b7746-7f3d-4445-9afa-c3bf2c5449cd
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2833, y: -246}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "To wszystko wina Tuska! Teraz Hajda my\u015Bli, \u017Ce
          jest ca\u0142kowicie bezkarny i poluje na nas, poczciwych emeryt\xF3w.
          A\u017C strach przez pasy przej\u015B\u0107..."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 1185023069381984410
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 71436129-3e38-4628-8115-1a0835cfaff8
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: ed890557-c11f-4259-b979-c7a2819c08f9
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d22b7746-7f3d-4445-9afa-c3bf2c5449cd
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 3545, y: -251}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "S\u0142uchaj, m\u0142ody cz\u0142owieku. Nabo\u017Ce\u0144stwo
          si\u0119 sko\u0144czy\u0142o dwie godziny temu, a my tu wci\u0105\u017C
          siedzimy, bo boimy si\u0119 wr\xF3ci\u0107 do domu, ten antychryst pewnie
          czai si\u0119 niedaleko jakiego\u015B przej\u015Bcia. Pom\xF3g\u0142by\u015B
          nas przeprowadzi\u0107 przez jezdni\u0119? Zrobi\u0142by\u015B dobry uczynek
          i przy okazji zarobi\u0142 troch\u0119 pieni\u0105\u017Ck\xF3w na lody."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 1185023069381984411
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
